BT 1 0 0 1 0 29.5 Tm /F1 9.5 Tf 13 TL (This lab applies four standard operating-system techniques to small, reproducible xv6 programs. The first two) Tj T* (programs are deterministic simulations. The last two create real xv6 child processes and use pipe-backed counting) Tj T* (semaphores so that resource ownership is visible in the terminal.) Tj T* ET
