BT 1 0 0 1 0 55.5 Tm /F1 9.5 Tf 13 TL -0.043761 Tw (resourceorder.c uses pipe tokens as counting-semaphore permits. In the first phase, Process A takes Lock1 before) Tj T* 0 Tw (Lock2 while Process B takes Lock2 before Lock1. A delay makes the circular wait visible; the parent reports a) Tj T* (timeout and terminates the demonstration. In the second phase, both children always take Lock1 before Lock2.) Tj T* (This removes circular wait because a process can never wait for a lower-ranked lock while holding a higher-ranked) Tj T* (one.) Tj T* ET
